{"id":"seguridad","lemma":"seguridad","pos":"noun","rank":363,"glosses":["safety, security","self-confidence"],"ipa":"/seɡuɾiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"seguridades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-seguridad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es por tu propia seguridad.","en":"It's for your own safety.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611767","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"own","l":"propio"},null]},{"text":"Estaba muy preocupado por tu seguridad.","en":"I was very concerned for your safety.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582005","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"worried, concerned"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"He llamado a seguridad.","en":"I called security.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/821302","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"called"},{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"Lo sé con seguridad.","en":"I know it for sure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449408","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"¿Puedes garantizar nuestra seguridad?","en":"Can you guarantee our safety?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600237","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to guarantee"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null]}]}